#. 【説明しておく事】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[what I have to tell you all]"
msgstr ""

#. みんなに説明しなくちゃいけないのは、
#. 最後の学級裁判の事なんだよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I need to tell you all about...the last class trial."
msgstr ""

#. …最後の学級裁判って？
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Last class trial...?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろの学級裁判を、
#. もう１度やり直すのよ…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We're going to redo Mukuro's trial."
msgstr ""

#. え！？　やり直すの！？
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What!? Seriously!?"
msgstr ""

#. やり直すも何も、苗木っちが犯人だったはずだべ！？
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What's the point of redoing it? Makoto killed her,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. だから…ボクじゃないんだって…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No, I didn't do it! Like I keep telling you..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君は犯人じゃないわ。
#. もちろん私でもないし、あなた達の誰でもない…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Makoto isn't the killer. And of course it's not me or\n"
"any of you."
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃあ…誰がやったの…？
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Th-Then...who is it?"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕の仕業…という事か…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What she's saying is, it was all the work of the\n"
"mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. は！？　黒幕が戦刃むくろを殺したって事か！？
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What!? You're saying the mastermind killed Mukuro!?"
msgstr ""

#. そう、すべては黒幕の仕組んだ罠だったのよ。
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's right. It was all an elaborate trap contrived\n"
"by the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. そして、苗木君はその罠に気付き、
#. それを阻止しようとした…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Makoto spotted the trap in time, and did what he had\n"
"to to stop it."
msgstr ""

#. そのせいで、彼が処刑される事になってしまったのよ…
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But his decision meant that *he* would be the one to\n"
"die."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木が…罠に気付いていたのか…
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You spotted the trap, did you Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこまでハッキリと気付いた訳じゃないけど…
#. まぁ、いいか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You make it sound like it was easy.\n"
"I just, ya know...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、犯人ではない苗木君を処刑するなんて行為は、
#. 明らかにルール違反でしょ？
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But executing Makoto, who *wasn't* the blackened, is a\n"
"clear violation of the school regulations."
msgstr ""

#. 校則にも『クロが処刑』と書いてあったはずよ。
#. つまり、黒幕は校則違反を犯したのよ。
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The rules state that *only* the blackened is to be\n"
"executed. The mastermind broke their own rules."
msgstr ""

#. だから、交渉してきたのよ。
#. もう１度、学級裁判をやり直すようにね…
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Which is why I went and negotiated with them to have\n"
"the trial one more time."
msgstr ""

#. それを黒幕が受けたの！？
#. 自分が作ったルールを破った程度で！？
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And the mastermind agreed!? Does that mean they really\n"
"did break the rules...?"
msgstr ""

#. …受けざるを得なかったんだろう。
#. 例の電波ジャックの件を交渉材料にしたんだな？
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"They had no choice but to agree. You used the TV\n"
"broadcast to gain the leverage you needed, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#. 気付いていたのね…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Very observant of you."
msgstr ""

#. 前の学級裁判が終わった後の
#. お前の言葉でな…
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I recall what you said at the end of the last trial..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>『追い詰められているのは黒幕の方』<CLT>という言葉は、
#. その事を指していたんだろう？
msgctxt "0024 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"When you said, \"<CLT 3>Now it's the mastermind that's\n"
"ensnared<CLT>,\" that's what you were referring to."
msgstr ""

#. おい！　俺が置いてけぼりだぞ！！
msgctxt "0025 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hey! I'm totally in the dark here!"
msgstr ""

#. わからないヤツは、後で霧切にでも聞け。
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"For anyone who doesn't understand, you can ask Kyoko\n"
"to explain it again. Later."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それで…
#. 結局…私達は何をすればいいの…？
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "So, knowing all th-this...what do we do now?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろを殺した真犯人…つまり黒幕の犯行を
#. 明らかにすればいいの？
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It's about who killed Mukuro, right? So our job is to\n"
"expose the mastermind...?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、それだけではないだろう？
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But there's more to it than that, correct?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、そうなんだ…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. ボク達が最後の学級裁判で勝つには、
#. この学園の謎をすべて解き明かす必要があるって…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"For us to win this time, we have to solve every last\n"
"mystery surrounding the school."
msgstr ""

#. 学園の謎を…すべて…？
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Every last mystery...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今までずっと調べてきたのに…
#. それでも、ほとんど何もわかってないんだよ？
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But we've been looking around all this time, and we\n"
"still don't know anything, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 薄々、勘付いているとは思うけど、
#. そこで負けた場合は、私達全員が処刑よ…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You've probably guessed already, but if we lose this\n"
"time...everyone dies."
msgstr ""

#. ぜ、全員処刑！？
msgctxt "0035 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "E-Everyone!?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと…ッ！
#. そ、そんな勝負…勝手に受けたりしないでよ…！！
msgctxt "0036 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"H-Hey! Who said you could agree to those t-terms\n"
"without talking to the rest of u-us!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしは…このままでいいのに…！
#. このまま…白夜様と暮らせるだけでいいのに…ッ！！
msgctxt "0037 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'm fine with things the w-way they are! I'm fine\n"
"living here forever with M-Master!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は一刻も早くここから出たいがな…
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I, meanwhile, want to get out of here as soon as\n"
"humanly possible."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、私達が生き延びるには、
#. 真実を明らかにするしかないわ…
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, at this point the only way for us to survive\n"
"is to unravel the truth."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、最終決戦という訳か…
#. なかなか面白い展開じゃないか。
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"In other words, one decisive final battle. A rather\n"
"interesting development, I'd say."
msgstr ""

#. でも、黒幕の正体とその犯行の謎を解き明かして、
#. その上、この学園の謎も明らかにしろなんて…
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But figuring out who the mastermind is, AND how they\n"
"killed Mukuro, AND all the school's mysteries..."
msgstr ""

#. 盛りだくさんだべ…
msgctxt "0042 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's a pretty tall friggin' order..."
msgstr ""

#. だけどさ、今回は今までの学級裁判と違って、
#. 敵はハッキリしてるんだし…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Maybe, but this time the trial is different. We know\n"
"who our enemy is now."
msgstr ""

#. だから、みんなで協力して捜査すれば、
#. きっと謎を解き明かせるはずだよ！
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So if we work together and search as hard as we can,\n"
"I'm sure we'll solve all those mysteries!"
msgstr ""

#. それはどうかしら…
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm not so sure about that."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. みんなで協力して捜査するって意見には、
#. <CLT 1>【賛成出来ない】<CLT>わね…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I <CLT 1>[can't agree]<CLT> with the idea of working together\n"
"with everyone."
msgstr ""

#. 【賛成出来ない】
msgctxt "0048 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[Can't agree]"
msgstr ""

#. …賛成出来ないって、どうして？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You...can't agree? Why not?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、学園の謎を解くなんて、
#. みんなで協力して捜査した方がいいに決まってるのに…
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I mean, working together with everyone seems like the\n"
"most obvious way to solve all the mysteries..."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、私もそう思っていたわ…
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's what I thought, too...at first."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマの…あの言葉を聞くまではね…
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Until Monokuma gave us that little hint of his..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの言葉…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hint...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. クックック…
#. むしろ、ついでにヒントをもう１つやるクマ…
msgctxt "0054 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Kehehe... It's a very polarizing approach, I know,\n"
"but—okay, enough puns. Anyway, here's a hint..."
msgstr ""

#. 確か、前にも言ったと思うクマ…
msgctxt "0055 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm sure I told you this already, but..."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>の参加者は、
#. 全部で１６人の高校生だけだって…
msgctxt "0056 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...this <CLT 3>killing game<CLT> began with sixteen\n"
"participants, all of them high school students."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、コロシアイ学園生活が始まった後、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園に生きたまま足を踏み入れた人間も…
msgctxt "0057 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And the only people to take a single step in Hope's\n"
"Peak since the killing game began..."
msgstr ""

#. その１６人だけだったクマ。
msgctxt "0058 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...are those sixteen students."
msgstr ""

#. なるほどな…モノクマがそんな事を言ったのか…
msgctxt "0059 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Monokuma said that, did he?"
msgstr ""

#. だとすると、霧切の意見ももっともだな。
msgctxt "0060 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then Kyoko's opinion is perfectly reasonable."
msgstr ""

#. え？　なんで？
msgctxt "0061 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? But why...?"
msgstr ""

#. さっき、霧切が言ったように、
#. 戦刃むくろを殺したのが黒幕だとすると…
msgctxt "0062 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If the mastermind really is the one who killed Mukuro,\n"
"as Kyoko says..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、この学園内に
#. 足を踏み入れていた事になるはずだ。
msgctxt "0063 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...then the mastermind would have had to set foot in\n"
"this school, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 殺すだけならまだしも、植物庭園の偽装工作は、
#. モノクマを操作するだけでは不可能だからな。
msgctxt "0064 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma could probably murder Mukuro, but there's no\n"
"way he could have disguised the scene like that."
msgstr ""

#. だが、モノクマが言うには、
#. 生きたまま、この学園に足を踏み入れた人間は…
msgctxt "0065 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But according to Monokuma, the only people who have\n"
"set foot in Hope's Peak..."
msgstr ""

#. コロシアイ学園生活の参加者である
#. <CLT 3>１６人の高校生だけ<CLT>だったらしい…
msgctxt "0066 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...are the <CLT 3>sixteen students<CLT> who have been taking\n"
"part in the killing game."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…黒幕の正体って…！？
msgctxt "0067 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Then...the m-mastermind is...!"
msgstr ""

#. 最初に玄関ホールに揃った１５人…
msgctxt "0068 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"There were fifteen of us in the m-main hall at the\n"
"very beginning..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そこに…戦刃むくろを加えた１６人…
msgctxt "0069 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Add in M-Mukuro, and you get sixteen..."
msgstr ""

#. その中に…いるって事…？
msgctxt "0070 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "So the mastermind w-would have to be...one of them?"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、その１６人の中で生き残っているのは…
msgctxt "0071 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And of those sixteen people we started out with, the\n"
"only ones still alive..."
msgstr ""

#. …ここにいる俺達だけだ。
#. その先は言わなくてもわかるな？
msgctxt "0072 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...are the people standing right here. Need I\n"
"continue, or do you get it now?"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕はこの中にいるって事か！？
msgctxt "0073 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You're saying the mastermind is one of us!?"
msgstr ""

#. ウ、ウソでしょ！？
msgctxt "0074 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Y-You can't be serious!"
msgstr ""

#. ま、待ってよ！
#. まだ、そう決まった訳じゃないよ！
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Wait! We can't say for sure that's true yet!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなの、モノクマがボクらを混乱させる為に
#. 言っただけかもしれないし…
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma might have just said all that to confuse\n"
"us...!"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、その可能性はあるわね。
#. でも、それだって可能性の１つに過ぎないわ。
msgctxt "0077 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's certainly a possibility. But only one among\n"
"many..."
msgstr ""

#. この中に黒幕がいる可能性と、
#. 同じようにね…
msgctxt "0078 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind being one of us is *also* a\n"
"possibility."
msgstr ""

#. …可能性がある以上は放って置けまい。
msgctxt "0079 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And that is one possibility we can't ignore."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうよね…<CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>って時点で…
#. 黒幕は、高校生には間違いないはずだし…
msgctxt "0080 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I mean, they're an u-ultimate, right? The\n"
"<CLT 3>Ultimate Despair<CLT>. So they m-must be a high schooler!"
msgstr ""

#. 可能性は…ゼロとは言い切れない…！
msgctxt "0081 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You can't say it's not p-possible...!"
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、ボク達の中に黒幕がいるとしたら、
#. その人がモノクマを操ってたって事でしょ？
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if one of us was the mastermind, they'd have to be\n"
"controlling Monokuma somehow, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、モノクマが動いている時に、
#. そんな怪しい行動をしている人なんていた？
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But did you ever see anyone acting suspicious anytime\n"
"Monokuma was active?"
msgstr ""

#. こ、こっそり姿を消して…裏で操ってたのかも…
msgctxt "0084 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Maybe they s-snuck off and controlled him i-in\n"
"secret..."
msgstr ""

#. いくら、こっそりでも…
#. 何回も姿を消してたら誰か気付くよ…
msgctxt "0085 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I don't care how sneaky you are, we would've noticed\n"
"someone sneaking off that many times."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、モノクマは全自動だったんだべ。
#. 会話と行動をあらかじめインプットしとくんだ！
msgctxt "0086 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Then maybe Monokuma was on autopilot! Maybe they\n"
"loaded up all the dialogue and actions beforehand!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、あんなスムーズな会話なんて出来ないよ。
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In that case, there's no way he could have had all\n"
"those back-and-forth conversations with us."
msgstr ""

#. いや、誰かが会話を誘導すれば、
#. 不可能ではないはずだ。
msgctxt "0088 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well...it wouldn't be entirely impossible, if they\n"
"directed the flow of the conversation."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうかもしれないけど…
#. だ、だけど…やっぱり…！
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well, maybe...but still!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Bíng bong, bing bong”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
msgctxt "0091 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahh, this is a school announcement."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ、すでにご承知かと思いますが…
msgctxt "0092 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You've all probably figured this out by now, but..."
msgstr ""

#. これから、このコロシアイ学園生活は
#. <CLT 3>“真の解答編”<CLT>へと突入しまーす。
msgctxt "0093 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...at this point, the killing game has now entered\n"
"\"<CLT 3>True Ending<CLT>\" mode."
msgstr ""

#. そこで公平を期す為に、
#. 学園内の部屋のロックはすべて解除しちゃいます！
msgctxt "0094 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So in the name of fairness, I will unlock every room\n"
"in the school!"
msgstr ""

#. 好きに調べてチョーダイな！
#. 思う存分、謎を解いてチョーダイな！
msgctxt "0095 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Look wherever you want! Solve the mystery in whatever\n"
"way you see fit!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…では学級裁判でお会いしましょう…
msgctxt "0096 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... Then we can all meet up at the class trial,\n"
"okay?"
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0097 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Gaahahaha! Ahahaha...!"
msgstr ""

#. すべてのロックを解除するなんて…
#. ずいぶんと太っ腹ね。
msgctxt "0098 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "How very magnanimous of him to unlock all the rooms."
msgstr ""

#. …お喋りの時間は終わりだ。
#. さっさと捜査を始めるぞ。
msgctxt "0099 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The time for talk is done. Now we need to begin our\n"
"investigation."
msgstr ""

#. だ、だけど…
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But...!"
msgstr "N-Nhưng mà...!"

#. どっちにしろ、俺は最初から１人で行くつもりだ…
msgctxt "0101 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I was planning on working alone from the beginning\n"
"anyway."
msgstr ""

#. ここまで来たら、頼るのは自分自身だけだ。
#. 俺の中に流れる<CLT 3>“十神”<CLT>の血だけだ。
msgctxt "0102 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"At this point, I can rely only on myself, on the\n"
"<CLT 3>Togami blood<CLT> flowing through my veins."
msgstr ""

#. お前らも他人を気遣っている場合じゃないぞ。
#. 自分のやるべき事をちゃんとやれ…
msgctxt "0103 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I have no time to worry about the rest of you. Each of\n"
"you must uphold your responsibility."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあな…
msgctxt "0104 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well then..."
msgstr "Vậy sao..."

#. <CLT 4>それだけ言うと、
#. 十神クンはさっさと食堂を後にしてしまった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After making his final statement, Byakuya left the\n"
"dining hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ううっ…白夜様…！
msgctxt "0106 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Gaah! M-Master!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしを…連れてってくれなかった…！
msgctxt "0107 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "He didn't take me w-with him...!"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ…当然だべ。
msgctxt "0108 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Do ya blame him?"
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様のいない…あんた達なんて…
msgctxt "0109 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Without Master, the r-rest of you are like..."
msgstr ""

#. コーヒーと牛乳抜きの…コーヒー牛乳よ！
#. つ、つまり…
msgctxt "0110 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...coffee with cream w-without the cream! Or c-coffee!"
msgstr ""

#. 価値なし！
msgctxt "0111 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You're totally useless!"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だから…さようなら……
msgctxt "0112 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "S-So...bye!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、腐川さんも
#. １人とぼとぼと食堂から去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With that, Toko trudged out of the dining hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あーあ、行っちまったべ…
msgctxt "0114 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And now *she's* gone..."
msgstr ""

#. そんで、霧切っちも１人で行く気なんだろ？
msgctxt "0115 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And you're gonna go off by yourself, right Kyoko?"
msgstr ""

#. えぇ、そうね…
msgctxt "0116 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Đúng vậy."

#. …って事は、残るのは、
#. 苗木っちと朝日奈っちだけか…
msgctxt "0117 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Which just leaves Makoto, Hina, and me..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0118 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. じゃあ、１人で行動した方がマシだな…！
msgctxt "0119 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "In that case, I'm gonna go by myself, too!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、って何よ！？
msgctxt "0120 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wait, how come!?"
msgstr ""

#. 見てろ！　俺のイカした占いで、
#. 黒幕の正体をビシーッと当ててやんべ！！
msgctxt "0121 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Just wait and see! I'm gonna use my totally awesome\n"
"spirit power to figure out the mastermind's identity!"
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0122 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hahahaha!"
msgstr "Á ha ha ha!"

#. <CLT 4>そんな高笑いを響かせながら、
#. 葉隠クンは食堂を後にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Laughing loudly, Hiro left the dining hall...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あーあ…ホントにみんな…
#. １人で行っちゃうんだね…
msgctxt "0124 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Everyone's really gonna go off by themselves...?"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんは、どうするの…？
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What about you, Hina?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0126 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Umm..."
msgstr "Ờm..."

#. 私も…１人でやってみようかな…
msgctxt "0127 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I guess I'll do the same thing."
msgstr ""

#. でも、みんなを信用してない訳じゃないんだよ？
msgctxt "0128 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I mean, it's not that I don't trust everyone, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. ただ、私ってさ…
#. 今までずっと役立たずだったでしょ？
msgctxt "0129 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But...up till now, I haven't really been all that\n"
"useful."
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんとか…他のみんなに頼りっぱなしでさ…
msgctxt "0130 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I just depended on Sakura, and everyone else."
msgstr ""

#. 役立たずなんて、そんな事ないよ！
#. 朝日奈さんがいてくれて助かってるよ！
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're not useless! If you hadn't been here, I woulda\n"
"died!"
msgstr ""

#. な、苗木…！
msgctxt "0132 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "M-Makoto...!"
msgstr ""

#. ううっ…苗木が優しいっす…！
msgctxt "0133 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Nng...that's really nice of you to say...!"
msgstr ""

#. …でもね、大して役に立ててないのは、
#. やっぱりホントだよ…
msgctxt "0134 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But still, I know I've mostly been totally useless."
msgstr ""

#. だからね、最後くらいは頑張って、
#. みんなの役に立つ手掛かりを見つけようと思ってさ。
msgctxt "0135 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So I figure, at least here at the end, maybe I can\n"
"find something that'll help us all get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. だから、私も１人でやってみるよ！
msgctxt "0136 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So I'm gonna go off and do it all on my own!"
msgstr ""

#. という訳で、また後でねーッ！！
msgctxt "0137 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay, see ya later!"
msgstr "Được rồi, gặp lại sau nhé!"

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんは威勢よく、
#. 食堂から走り去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina was in surprisingly high spirits as she dashed\n"
"out of the dining hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、残ったのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0139 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And once again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. また…ボク達だけだね…
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...it's just us two."
msgstr ""

#. そうね…
msgctxt "0141 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr "Đúng vậy."

#. <CLT 4>食堂にやって来たボクと霧切さんを
#. 出迎えたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0142 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And suddenly, we were greeted with...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おきＦやじょち、あんｊｃじ；うぇｃるいおうんｃり！
msgctxt "0143 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Skrgh@yaGfew, anji&\\krakAW;! fzzlbRff#[]"
msgstr ""

#. また…お前か…
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You again..."
msgstr ""

#. うえｆに…におｆｊｍｖ：ｍろい￥おｔｖぺｖじえお…
msgctxt "0145 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hrskzzzz_dat.; EgspllER103.2.1.255"
msgstr ""

#. …壊れてるのか？
msgctxt "0146 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is he...broken?"
msgstr ""

#. 情緒不安定にもほどがあるわね…
msgctxt "0147 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I suppose his emotional instability reached its limit."
msgstr ""

#. ｓｋそｇんｘｙ。ぁｌｖんくえいう２３－ｆｔんｆ８？
msgctxt "0148 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "aG^3. 4sum=(SEN|akt~____ 61!"
msgstr ""

#. 行っちゃった…けど…
msgctxt "0149 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Jeez... What the heck?"
msgstr ""

#. 結局、なんだったのかしら…？
msgctxt "0150 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I wonder what that was all about..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>思わずため息をついた…のもつかの間。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't help but let out a sigh of relief.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あッ！？
msgctxt "0152 | NO NAME"
msgid "Ah—!"
msgstr "A—!"

#. 苗木…だよね…？
msgctxt "0153 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Is that...Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. み、みんな…ッ！
msgctxt "0154 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-You guys!"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり苗木だ！　どの角度から見ても苗木だよ！
msgctxt "0155 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It is! There's no two ways about it, that's Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あら…生きてたのね…？
msgctxt "0156 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? You s-survived?"
msgstr ""

#. まったく…ゴキブリ並のしぶとさだな…
msgctxt "0157 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Jeez... You're like a stubborn little cockroach, you\n"
"know that?"
msgstr ""

#. 念の為に聞いとくけど…幽霊じゃねーよな？
msgctxt "0158 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'm just asking to make sure, but...you're not a\n"
"ghost, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには、みんなの姿があった。
#. 共に戦い…生き残った仲間達の姿…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Everyone was there. All my friends who had struggled\n"
"together...and survived...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな、みんなの顔を見た途端、
#. ボクは思わず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as I saw their faces, I couldn't\n"
"help myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ちょっとだけ…涙が……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I started to tear up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 待て…何か匂うぞ…
msgctxt "0162 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Wait...what's that smell?"
msgstr ""

#. マジだな…臭いべ…
msgctxt "0163 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yeah man, that seriously stinks!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木だ！　苗木から洗ってない犬の匂いがする！
msgctxt "0164 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's Makoto! He smells like a wet dog!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あっち行きなさい…しっ、しっ！
msgctxt "0165 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "G-Get away! Shoo! Shoo!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0166 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>涙は一瞬で引っ込んだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0167 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And in a flash, my tears dried up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、感動の再会に浸っている時間はないわよ。
msgctxt "0168 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's no time to indulge in an extended happy\n"
"reunion."
msgstr ""

#. さっきのモノクマとの件…
#. みんなに説明しておかないとね。
msgctxt "0169 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We need to explain to everyone what happened with\n"
"Monokuma."
msgstr ""

#. …説明だと？　なんの話だ？
msgctxt "0170 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Explain...? Explain what?"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、苗木っちは脱走して大丈夫なんか？
#. 黒幕に見つかったら、ヤバくね？
msgctxt "0171 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But is it okay that you're here? What if the\n"
"mastermind catches you?"
msgstr ""

#. それにも関係しているんだけど、
#. みんなに<CLT 1>【説明しておく事】<CLT>があるのよ…
msgctxt "0172 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's related to <CLT 1>[what I have to tell you all]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. まさか！　やっぱり苗木っちは幽霊とか！？
msgctxt "0173 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Don't tell me! Did he turn into a gh-gh-gh-ghost!?"
msgstr ""

#. 透けてないじゃん…
msgctxt "0174 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Does he look transparent to you?"
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハ！　幽霊が透けるなんて迷信だべ！
#. 透けてたら日常生活に支障をきたすべ！
msgctxt "0175 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hah! That's just a silly superstition! If ghosts were\n"
"see-through, they couldn't lead normal lives!"
msgstr ""

#. もういいや…あんたと話しても疲れるだけだ…
msgctxt "0176 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Okay...okay, that's enough. Talking to you makes me\n"
"want to just lay down and go to sleep."
msgstr ""

#. みんなで協力して捜査するって意見には、
#. 私は<CLT 1>【賛成出来ない】<CLT>わね…
msgctxt "0177 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I <CLT 1>[can't agree]<CLT> with the idea of working together\n"
"with everyone."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんも…１人で行くんだよね…？
msgctxt "0178 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...you're gonna go off on your own too, right Kyoko?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、勘違いしないで…
msgctxt "0179 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well, don't misunderstand."
msgstr ""

#. 別々に捜査するからと言って、
#. 協力し合えない訳じゃないのよ。
msgctxt "0180 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just because we're going to do our searches separately\n"
"doesn't mean we can't still work together."
msgstr ""

#. それは、みんなも同じはずよ…
msgctxt "0181 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That goes for all of us."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そっか…そうだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0182 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think I see what you mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>別行動だからって、
#. 協力し合えない訳じゃないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0183 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Doing our own investigating doesn't mean we can't work\n"
"together in the end.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>手分けして捜査してる…そう思えばいいんだよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0184 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should just see it as us splitting up to cover more\n"
"ground.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それで、その後で、
#. 協力し合えばいいんだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0185 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then we can get back together and share what we\n"
"found.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…うん、そうだよな！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0186 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah...that's right!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、私もそろそろ行くわよ。
#. 調べる事が山積みだから…
msgctxt "0187 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well, I'd better get going. I have an endless list of\n"
"things I need to check."
msgstr ""

#. さっき、モノクマは、
#. 学園内のロックをすべて解除したと言っていたわ。
msgctxt "0188 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma said all the doors in the school had been\n"
"unlocked, right?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、この学園のすべての場所が
#. 捜査可能になっているはずよ…
msgctxt "0189 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So we should be able to investigate every nook and\n"
"cranny in the school."
msgstr ""

#. 今まで行けなかった場所にも…
#. 行けるって事だよね…
msgctxt "0190 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "We can visit all the places we couldn't go before..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、必ず真実を解き明かしましょうね…
msgctxt "0191 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Makoto...no matter what it takes, we *have* to uncover\n"
"the truth."
msgstr ""

#. 必ず…ね…
msgctxt "0192 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "By any means necessary..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、霧切さんも去っていき…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0193 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With that, Kyoko was gone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ボクだけが残った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0194 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leaving only me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ボクも…のんびりしている時間はないんだ…
msgctxt "0195 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't have time to waste, either."
msgstr ""

#. そうだ…始めないと…
msgctxt "0196 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I have to begin my search..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらの中に黒幕が潜んでいるなんて…
#. ボクには、やっぱり信じられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0197 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I still can't believe the mastermind might be one of\n"
"us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、ボクがそれを証明してみせる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0198 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that's what I have to prove...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は、ボクらの誰かなんかじゃないって、
#. ボク自身が証明してみせる！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0199 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'll prove that the mastermind ISN'T one of us!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それで、黒幕の正体を暴いて…
#. この学園の謎を解いて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0200 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'll expose the mastermind's true identity, and solve\n"
"the mystery of this school...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. みんなで、ここから出て行くんだ！！
msgctxt "0201 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...and then we can all escape together!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まずは、戦刃むくろに関するモノクマファイルに、
#. もう１度、目を通しておこう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0202 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I'll start by taking another look at Mukuro's\n"
"Monokuma File...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>爆破による損傷が激しい為、死体の身元は不明。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0203 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"Due to the explosion, the victim's identity\n"
"is unknown.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この爆破は、被害者の死後に行われている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0204 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"They were, however, dead before the blast.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腹部のナイフの傷は背中まで達している。
#. このナイフによる刺し傷は、１ヵ所のみ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0205 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The victim had been stabbed a single time with a\n"
"knife, which went completely through the body.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>また、後頭部に殴られた形跡もある。
#. 鉄パイプ程度の太さの棒状の物で殴られた様子。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0206 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"They had also been struck in the head with an object\n"
"about as thick as a metal pipe.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他にも、全身に数多くの傷跡があるが、
#. ここ数日のものではなく、以前からあった傷のようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0207 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The body was covered with other wounds, but these\n"
"were at least several days old.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろ…
#. 正体不明の彼女を殺した犯人が…
msgctxt "0208 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Once we find out who killed Mukuro Ikusaba..."
msgstr ""

#. …黒幕の正体。
msgctxt "0209 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...then we'll know who the mastermind is."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと、その犯行を解き明かす為に、
#. ボクが捜査すべき場所は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0210 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So, where should I start my investigation to figure\n"
"out who killed her...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. まずは、今まで鍵が掛かってて、
#. 行けなかった部屋だよな…
msgctxt "0211 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I guess I should start with the rooms that were locked\n"
"up until now."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>４階の学園長室、５階の生物室、
#. ４階の情報処理室にあったモノクマ模様のドア…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0212 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The headmaster's room, the bio lab, and the door in\n"
"the data center with Monokuma's face on it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、シャッターが降りてた寄宿舎の２階…
#. あそこのロックも解除されたって事だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0213 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, and the 2nd floor of the dorms where the gate was\n"
"down before... That should be open now, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 後は、殺人と直接関係している場所も、
#. もう１度調べておく必要がありそうだな…
msgctxt "0214 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"After that, I'll have to double-check the areas that\n"
"are connected to the murder..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>植物庭園と武道場か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0215 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which means the garden and the dojo...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よし！　じゃあ、始めるぞ！！
msgctxt "0216 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay! Time to get started!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>調べるべき場所メモ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0217 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Places to Check<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. まったく、よく生きていたもんだ…
msgctxt "0218 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I still can't believe you survived."
msgstr ""

#. うん、ボクも信じられないよ…
msgctxt "0219 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, me either..."
msgstr ""

#. わかっているのか？
#. どうして、お前は処刑を免れる事が出来たのか…
msgctxt "0220 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Do you realize why it is you escaped execution."
msgstr ""

#. アルターエゴ…だよね？
msgctxt "0221 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was...Alter Ego."
msgstr ""

#. 彼が…ボクの命を助けてくれたんだ…
msgctxt "0222 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He...saved my life."
msgstr ""

#. プログラム如きに命を助けられた人間など、
#. なかなかいないはずだ…
msgctxt "0223 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Not too many people can say they had their lives saved\n"
"by a computer program."
msgstr ""

#. フン、貴重な経験をしたじゃないか…
msgctxt "0224 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I imagine it was a learning experience for you."
msgstr ""

#. プログラム如きに命を助けられた人間など、
#. なかなかいないはずだ…
msgctxt "0225 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Very few people have been saved by a computer program."
msgstr ""

#. 貴重な経験をしたな…
msgctxt "0226 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It must have been quite the learning experience..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っち、霊界はどうだった！？
msgctxt "0227 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Makoto! What was it like hanging out in the spirit\n"
"world!?"
msgstr ""

#. 行ってないよ…
msgctxt "0228 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I...didn't go to the spirit world."
msgstr ""

#. 先生とは会ったか？
msgctxt "0229 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Did you get to talk to her?"
msgstr ""

#. 先生…？
msgctxt "0230 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#. たんば先生だ…
msgctxt "0231 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Miss Cleo!"
msgstr ""

#. 会ってないよ。
#. て言うか、行ってないし…
msgctxt "0232 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"No, I didn't talk to her. I mean, I didn't go to the\n"
"spirit world...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>て言うか、誰だよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0233 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean—who the heck is Miss Cleo?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そうか、たんば先生には会えなかったか…！
msgctxt "0234 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So you didn't get to talk to her, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 修行が足りんべ！
msgctxt "0235 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Sounds like you lack discipline!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんのだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0236 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I lack discipline...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さん達は、
#. 今までどこに行ってたの…？
msgctxt "0237 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So what have you guys been doing while I was gone?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろの学級裁判が終わったから、
#. 行ける場所が増えたんじゃないかと思ったんだけど…
msgctxt "0238 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Well, we figured that since the trial was over, we'd\n"
"have access to new places again."
msgstr ""

#. …どうだったの？
msgctxt "0239 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん、ダメだったよ。
#. 鍵の掛かった部屋もそのままだったし…
msgctxt "0240 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"No dice. All the rooms that were locked before...were\n"
"still locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>新しく行ける場所はないって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0241 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there weren't any new areas...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、新しい手掛かりは、
#. どこで見つければいいんだよ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0242 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then where can we go to find new clues?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろの学級裁判が終わったから、
#. 行ける場所が増えたんじゃないかと思ったんだけど…
msgctxt "0243 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Well, we figured that since the trial was over, we'd\n"
"have access to new places again."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事なかったよ…
#. 鍵の掛かった部屋もそのままだった…
msgctxt "0244 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But no dice. All the rooms that were locked\n"
"before...were still locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>新しく行ける場所はないって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0245 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there weren't any new areas...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、新しい手掛かりは、
#. どこで見つければいいんだよ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0246 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then where can we go to find new clues?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 臭い…臭いわ…
#. あんた…腐ってんじゃないの…ッ！？
msgctxt "0247 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ugh, you s-stink...! Are you rotten!?"
msgstr ""

#. 色んな意味で腐ってんじゃないの！？
#. も、もちろん人間としてもよ！
msgctxt "0248 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Rotten ph-physically, mentally, every way you can b-be\n"
"rotten!"
msgstr ""

#. ごめん…ずっとゴミ捨て場にいたからさ…
msgctxt "0249 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sorry... I was rolling around in garbage for a while."
msgstr ""

#. なんなの…この匂い…
#. 強烈な臭さよ…！
msgctxt "0250 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "This smell is s-so...smelly...!"
msgstr ""

#. アハハ…！　臭い臭い…！
#. あたしより臭いわ…！　あたしよりもね…ッ！
msgctxt "0251 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ahaha! Super smelly! You smell even w-worse than me!\n"
"Way worse than m-me!"
msgstr ""

#. …勝ったわ。
msgctxt "0252 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...I win."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…嬉しそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0253 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She seems...happy for some reason.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. アハハ…！　臭い臭い…！
#. あたしより臭いわ…！　あたしよりもね…ッ！
msgctxt "0254 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ahaha! Super smelly! You smell even w-worse than me!\n"
"Way worse than m-me!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんで…嬉しそうなんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0255 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why does she seem so happy about that?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は何も映ってないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0256 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"There's nothing on it right now, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それでも見ているだけで、
#. なんだか腹立たしい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0257 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...even when it's off, just looking at it wears me\n"
"down.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0258 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Từ tận đáy lòng, mình thực sự chỉ muốn...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0259 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今、ここで厨房に行っても、
#. 仕方がないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0260 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I need to go to the kitchen right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は…夜みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0261 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like it's night...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで出ていっても意味がないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0262 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I probably shouldn't leave...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0263 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0264 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0265 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
